# 1. Project Overview


This project analyzes TCP connection performance using Mininet and Wireshark.

The objective is to compare two TCP communication approaches:


1. Persistent TCP Connection

2. New TCP Connection Per Message



The performance comparison is performed using:

- Response Time
- Throughput
- TCP Handshake Analysis
- Packet Level Observation

The experiment is implemented using:

- Python TCP Socket Programming
- Mininet Network Emulator
- Wireshark Packet Analyzer

