13. Performance Measurement
Response Time

Formula:

Response Time = ACK Receive Time - Send Time


For every message:

Start Timer

Send Message

Receive ACK

Stop Timer

Average Response Time
Average Response Time =

Total Response Time / Number of Messages

Throughput
Throughput =

Total Bytes Sent / Total Time


Unit:

Bytes per Second (B/s)

