20. Conclusion

The experiment successfully analyzed TCP performance using Mininet and Wireshark.

Persistent TCP communication provides better performance because it reduces connection establishment overhead.

New connection mode provides simplicity but increases latency.

The experiment demonstrates the importance of connection management in network performance.


